{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1557561-ananasi-quick-interrogation","id":1557561,"title":"Ananasi quick interrogation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-01-13T15:16:56-08:00","id":1557561,"title":"Ananasi quick interrogation","content":"Let's say a vampire feed from an ananasi, would he drain the blood point first and then the actual blood of the creature? Would he be able to feed from the ananasi blood pool at all? And if yes does that mean that if an ananasi suffer an hemorrhage she first lose his blood pool and only after that suffer lethal damage when it's empty?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26839-cain-loup-noir","name":"Cain Loup-Noir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26839_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-13T15:57:08-08:00","id":1557564,"title":"","content":"Much of that answer is homebrew/fanon convention since no official rules exist, but:<br /> <br /> Ananasi drink and metabolize the blood, meaning their Blood Pool is merely a convenience representation of how much 'nourishment' is in their system. It may be better to think of it as a 'Protein Pool' - unless the vampire drinks directly from an Ananasi's stomach who recently fed, they won't be able to access that blood.<br /> <br /> The books <i>do</i> state that Ananasi have Ichor, which isn't blood. In fact, it's outright vile and undrinkable for vampires. It is also probably the reason they can not be blood bound.<br /> <br /> As background, spiders have no blood. They have hemolymph, which takes the role of oxygen and nourishment transport medium. There are quite a few physical problems with scaling spider anatomy up to Ananasi size, and one of them is the open circulatory system of spiders - for that reason, it is assumed that all forms except Crawlerling have a vascular system and Ichor, and only full spider anatomy while in the right size - along with things like different lungs, endoskeltons, and a bunch of other more mammalian characteristics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1550552-ma%C5%A1ma%C5%A1%C5%A1%C5%ABtu-mesopotamian-sorcery\" target=\"_blank\">Ma\u0161ma\u0161\u0161\u016btu</a> | Necromancy:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1514352\" target=\"_blank\"> Dust Path</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1535508-dav20-older-lamia-lore?p=1536244#post1536244\" target=\"_blank\">P.o.Fertile Grave Soil</a> | Thauma: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1515316\" target=\"_blank\">Ars Notoria</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27477-voidshaper","name":"voidshaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-15T08:26:35-08:00","id":1557651,"title":"","content":"Interesting, and what about ananasi feeding from ghouls? Would they drain their small blood pool before draining their human blood (dealing damage at that point) or would it be the same as you described? Ghouls blood pool being more a protein pool? And if she feed from a vampire, could she ingest vitae to fill it's own pool?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26839-cain-loup-noir","name":"Cain Loup-Noir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26839_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-15T10:07:45-08:00","id":1557654,"title":"","content":"Yeah, Ghouls (or Revenants) work similar. They are still alive, and their Blood Pool represents the amount of vitae in their system. If you poke a Ghoul, they bleed blood and take damage. At least up to V20, I don't know how V5 Ghouls work.<br /> <br /> The thing with Ananasi is that they are basically completely immune to all effects of vitae, and that goes both ways. A vampire may find a Ghoul's blood more nourishing, but for an Ananasi it just tastes funny. If an Ananasi would try to drink directly from a vampire, they would only get icky dead blood that gives them no nourishment out of it.<br /> <br /> It's the same for Ananasi drinking blood from any other supernatural, too: Garou blood may be super potent for a vampire, the Ananasi gets normal blood and hairs stuck between her teeth. Changeling blood doesn't space them out, etc.<br /> <br /> So:<br /> <br /> Ananasi drinking from Ghoul: Ananasi gets blood points, Ghoul takes damage.<br /> <br /> Ananasi drinking from Vampire: Ananasi gets nothing, Vampire loses blood points. Ananasi probably vomits the vitae back out.<br /> <br /> Vampire drinking from Ananasi: Ananasi gets damage, Vampire gets nothing. Vampire probably vomits out the ichor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1550552-ma%C5%A1ma%C5%A1%C5%A1%C5%ABtu-mesopotamian-sorcery\" target=\"_blank\">Ma\u0161ma\u0161\u0161\u016btu</a> | Necromancy:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1514352\" target=\"_blank\"> Dust Path</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1535508-dav20-older-lamia-lore?p=1536244#post1536244\" target=\"_blank\">P.o.Fertile Grave Soil</a> | Thauma: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1515316\" target=\"_blank\">Ars Notoria</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27477-voidshaper","name":"voidshaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-15T16:10:52-08:00","id":1557659,"title":"","content":"So basically Vitae and ananasi blood point are not actual blood flooding is the system of their body, it's rather a game representation of the &quot;energy&quot; it contains. If vampires could suffer hermorrhage they would not bleed their pool but simply lose health as ghouls and ananasi.<br /> My misconception come from those power that destroy/steal vampires blood pool like &quot;blood cauldron&quot;, &quot;theft of vitae&quot; or simply the fact that vampire can drink it directly from the neck of their peers like it was actual blood","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26839-cain-loup-noir","name":"Cain Loup-Noir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26839_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-16T00:21:56-08:00","id":1557669,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cain Loup-Noir</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1557561-ananasi-quick-interrogation?p=1557659#post1557659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If vampires could suffer hermorrhage they would not bleed their pool but simply lose health as ghouls and ananasi.<br /> My misconception come from those power that destroy/steal vampires blood pool like &quot;blood cauldron&quot;, &quot;theft of vitae&quot; or simply the fact that vampire can drink it directly from the neck of their peers like it was actual blood</div> </div> </div> </div>No, you got it right about Vampires. Their bodies contain <i>only</i> vitae, if they could hemorrhage, it would be vitae.<br /> <br /> Ghouls aren't Vampires because they haven't been drained of blood before they were fed vitae, the have blood <i>and</i> vitae. Because of that the vitae isn't separable from the Ghoul's blood.<br /> <br /> But vitae without magic properties is just rotten blood. Since Ananasi are immune to the magic properties, it's more or less spoiled food for them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>voidshaper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1557561-ananasi-quick-interrogation?p=1557654#post1557654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ananasi drinking from Vampire: Ananasi gets nothing, Vampire loses blood points.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1550552-ma%C5%A1ma%C5%A1%C5%A1%C5%ABtu-mesopotamian-sorcery\" target=\"_blank\">Ma\u0161ma\u0161\u0161\u016btu</a> | Necromancy:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1514352\" target=\"_blank\"> Dust Path</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1535508-dav20-older-lamia-lore?p=1536244#post1536244\" target=\"_blank\">P.o.Fertile Grave Soil</a> | Thauma: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1515316\" target=\"_blank\">Ars Notoria</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27477-voidshaper","name":"voidshaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-16T11:53:09-08:00","id":1557679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>voidshaper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1557561-ananasi-quick-interrogation?p=1557669#post1557669\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ghouls aren't Vampires because they haven't been drained of blood before they were fed vitae, the have blood <i>and</i> vitae. Because of that the vitae isn't separable from the Ghoul's blood.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, let's summurize all this:<br /> Ananasi: Their blood point cannot be lost through hemorrhage, bite or power like theft of vitae because it's more like protein reserve build on their blood meal<br /> <br /> Ghouls: Vitae is mixed with their own blood in a way that both regular blood and vitae are one, so if they hemmorrhage they lose their health but keep the vitae, it cannot be stolen independently from one another with theft of vitae's power or bite and if they die the vitae die with them<br /> <br /> Vampires: Vitae is dead blood concentrate in their veins instead of real blood, so if they're bitten or attacked with theft of vitae they lose their vitae<br /> <br /> That's clearer now, sometime it's hard to imagine what describe the rules, especially when the same terms refer to several things of different natures","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26839-cain-loup-noir","name":"Cain Loup-Noir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26839_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-16T12:39:12-08:00","id":1557681,"title":"","content":"I agree. Having three different creatures with a Blood Pool stat of which none describes the amount of actual blood in their bodies is very unfortunate nomenclature. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1550552-ma%C5%A1ma%C5%A1%C5%A1%C5%ABtu-mesopotamian-sorcery\" target=\"_blank\">Ma\u0161ma\u0161\u0161\u016btu</a> | Necromancy:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1514352\" target=\"_blank\"> Dust Path</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1535508-dav20-older-lamia-lore?p=1536244#post1536244\" target=\"_blank\">P.o.Fertile Grave Soil</a> | Thauma: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1515316\" target=\"_blank\">Ars Notoria</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27477-voidshaper","name":"voidshaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-03-09T14:37:06-07:00","id":1558755,"title":"","content":"This is a little more nuanced. Allow Me to break it down a bit:<br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ananasi:</span></b><br /> <br /> - Drink from a Vampire:<br /> Get sick. Vomit up the blood. Gain no benefit, and gain no other drawback.<br /> <br /> - Drink from a Ghoul:<br /> Gain no benefit from the mortal blood in its system, but it tastes funny. Vomit up the vampire blood in its system, gaining nothing from it, and potentially losing another blood point of the usable blood consumed from the ghoul.<br /> <br /> - Be fed upon by a (stupid) Vampire:<br /> The vampire gains nothing from this, except a bad taste in its mouth. Additionally, there's a very real chance that the Ananasi kills the offending vampire.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Kumo:</span></b><br /> - Drink from a Vampire:<br /> Gain blood points just like from any other vessel. Much like werespiders feeding from shifters, there would be no extra gain, save that Kumo enjoy the flavour of vampire blood, especially those of Marawa's Brood.<br /> <br /> - Drink from a Ghoul:<br /> Gain no benefit from the mortal blood in its system, but it tastes funny. Enjoy the flavour of the vampire blood in its system, gaining no special benefits from it beyond the consumed blood points, and potentially losing another blood point of the usable blood consumed from the ghoul.<br /> <br /> - Be fed upon by a (stupid) Vampire:<br /> The vampire gains nothing from this, except a bad taste in its mouth. Additionally, there's a very real chance that the Kumo kills the offending vampire, possibly even devouring it!<br /> <br /> <b>A</b>s an aside, while it's stated that the Kumo can and do enjoy feeding on vampires, there is nothing stated, either way, as to their ability to be blood bonded. As Garou can be blood bonded, I would personally suggest that Kumo are not resistant to the Blood Bond unless they take the Merit: Unbondable. They're the only werespiders that would make sense taking it, as others default to the Ananasi setting regarding vampire blood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23923-lord-vil","name":"Lord Vil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23923_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-03-12T04:15:29-07:00","id":1558819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cain Loup-Noir</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1557561-ananasi-quick-interrogation#post1557561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's say a vampire feed from an ananasi, would he drain the blood point first and then the actual blood of the creature? Would he be able to feed from the ananasi blood pool at all? And if yes does that mean that if an ananasi suffer an hemorrhage she first lose his blood pool and only after that suffer lethal damage when it's empty?</div> </div> </div> </div>Neither, they'd get a mouth full of crawlerling spiders!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-03-19T06:32:00-07:00","id":1558937,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DarkKing</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1557561-ananasi-quick-interrogation?p=1558819#post1558819\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Neither, they'd get a mouth full of crawlerling spiders!</div> </div> </div> </div>In the World of Darkness, the urban legend that the average person eats 12 spiders a year is true. And now we know why.<br /> <br /> <hr /><br /> V - &quot;Tell me Marco, as the only vampire who has fed on both a Risen and a Were-Spider, which one was worse?&quot;<br /> <br /> M - *whimpers as he rocks back and forth*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-03-20T07:11:47-07:00","id":1558949,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>voidshaper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1557561-ananasi-quick-interrogation?p=1557564#post1557564\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Ichor) is also probably the reason they can not be blood bound.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm going to go back on this, it's more likely their quasi-immunity and impossibility to be turned is a result of their Weaver heritage. Drones have similar characteristics, although more pronounced. Makes more sense to me if a half-spirit being shares traits with a possessed being of the same Spirit type.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1550552-ma%C5%A1ma%C5%A1%C5%A1%C5%ABtu-mesopotamian-sorcery\" target=\"_blank\">Ma\u0161ma\u0161\u0161\u016btu</a> | Necromancy:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1514352\" target=\"_blank\"> Dust Path</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1535508-dav20-older-lamia-lore?p=1536244#post1536244\" target=\"_blank\">P.o.Fertile Grave Soil</a> | Thauma: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1515316\" target=\"_blank\">Ars Notoria</a>